    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1667730/extras/ed24d54b1e7e6590f45bea7f6fd5b615.avif?t=1684842694\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1667730/extras/ec0181ad5e6b6db6edf15d61a29fe0ea.avif?t=1684842694\" /></div><br><br>\u201cForgotten Journey\u201d is a puzzle-oriented platformer, where the player will follow a linear path jumping, climbing, and solving puzzles with the help of an AI companion that will follow her.<br><br>After making a silly mistake while doing some reparations, Mainkah opens an interstellar gate and gets herself transported to an unknown world, which she will need to explore to find her way out of there. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1667730/extras/a40fc13b180859695c853dd6bb194d1f.avif?t=1684842694\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Puzzle solving<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1667730/extras/02b8e08f4d0e189f2cf3e033a7223323.poster.avif?t=1684842694\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1667730/extras/02b8e08f4d0e189f2cf3e033a7223323.webm?t=1684842694\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1667730/extras/02b8e08f4d0e189f2cf3e033a7223323.mp4?t=1684842694\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br></li><li> Scenic Landscapes<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1667730/extras/0cc6c63ee6b41ff43775ff7c8b380619.poster.avif?t=1684842694\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1667730/extras/0cc6c63ee6b41ff43775ff7c8b380619.webm?t=1684842694\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1667730/extras/0cc6c63ee6b41ff43775ff7c8b380619.mp4?t=1684842694\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br></li><li> Explore a new world<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1667730/extras/c476f79793a3c55c191ef43ab805f057.poster.avif?t=1684842694\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1667730/extras/c476f79793a3c55c191ef43ab805f057.webm?t=1684842694\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1667730/extras/c476f79793a3c55c191ef43ab805f057.mp4?t=1684842694\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br></li><li> Full of misteries<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1667730/extras/0b48b95ba45a44a6296d19db9757fcde.poster.avif?t=1684842694\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1667730/extras/0b48b95ba45a44a6296d19db9757fcde.webm?t=1684842694\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1667730/extras/0b48b95ba45a44a6296d19db9757fcde.mp4?t=1684842694\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1667730/extras/a0314dc9cb71f37107ea1d9189626940.avif?t=1684842694\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1667730/extras/b7fb21052b4ee44920ac761a6a17c605.avif?t=1684842694\" /></div><br><br>Forgotten Journey is a project developed by <u>Asvaq Games</u>, a team of 4th Year students at DigiPen Institute of Technology Europe - Bilbao () in a 9-month development cycle using Unreal Engine 4.</li></ul>",
